WEBVTT

00:15.306 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:59.953 --> 02:00.829
Your Royal Highness,

02:01.663 --> 02:03.248
why are you discarding this?

02:03.331 --> 02:05.166
After eating nothing but this for days,

02:06.126 --> 02:07.752
the mere sight of it makes me sick.

02:10.839 --> 02:12.090
Exactly.

02:13.133 --> 02:15.635
Why did you do something so dangerous?

02:16.094 --> 02:17.345
You are reckless.

02:17.804 --> 02:19.472
You did not need
to put yourself through this.

02:21.182 --> 02:23.059
I did not do it for my own sake.

02:24.185 --> 02:25.895
If I am dethroned,

02:26.354 --> 02:28.064
do you think
my personal guards will be safe?

02:28.148 --> 02:31.109
Your kind wife will also likely be killed.

02:31.943 --> 02:33.027
Exactly.

02:33.403 --> 02:35.238
You shouldn't have schemed such a thing.

02:35.738 --> 02:38.366
You speak way too damn much.

02:40.034 --> 02:42.412
Someone so noble like Your Royal Highness
should not say "damn."

02:42.996 --> 02:45.331
Where did you pick up such a term?

02:45.415 --> 02:46.833
Where do you think?

02:47.500 --> 02:50.545
You are the only person around me
who speaks that way.

02:51.254 --> 02:52.088
I see.

02:52.714 --> 02:55.091
I must admit
that you are quite a fast learner--

02:55.175 --> 02:58.970
I must have been too nice to you.
You just don't know when to stop.

02:59.804 --> 03:03.391
Say one more word,
and I shall annihilate your entire family.

03:11.482 --> 03:12.483
I only said it in jest.

03:14.194 --> 03:15.320
Do not be angry.

03:16.529 --> 03:18.448
How could you jest about
something like that?

03:20.366 --> 03:22.410
How can the Crown Prince's personal guard

03:22.535 --> 03:24.454
be so cowardly? You are useless.

03:24.913 --> 03:26.372
How could I not be afraid

03:26.456 --> 03:28.249
when the Crown Prince says

03:28.541 --> 03:29.584
he would annihilate my family?

03:31.461 --> 03:32.795
Does this amuse you?

03:35.548 --> 03:36.633
What is so amusing about this?

03:46.643 --> 03:47.977
Is this the right path?

03:49.395 --> 03:51.189
They told us
to head to Geumjeong Mountain.

03:51.856 --> 03:54.275
This is Geumjeong Mountain,
so we will get there soon.

03:54.859 --> 03:56.027
You said that before.

03:57.237 --> 03:59.239
If we do not arrive there
within 30 minutes,

03:59.739 --> 04:01.699
I shall annihilate your family.

04:04.035 --> 04:06.955
Your Royal Highness,
do you truly enjoy jesting about that?

04:07.664 --> 04:08.831
I do.

04:12.835 --> 04:14.420
Keep jesting about annihilating my family

04:15.171 --> 04:17.048
if it amuses you, Your Royal Highness.

04:17.799 --> 04:22.095
In return, please bestow me with
some seaweed from Gijang if we survive.

04:22.178 --> 04:24.764
I hear that is the best
for pregnant women.

04:24.847 --> 04:26.599
I would appreciate some beef, too.

04:29.560 --> 04:30.603
It is very odd.

04:31.104 --> 04:31.980
Pardon?

04:32.814 --> 04:33.815
Your Royal Highness,

04:33.898 --> 04:36.025
I left behind my pregnant wife
who is due any day now.

04:36.109 --> 04:39.237
Is it that odd of me to ask for
some seaweed from Gijang?

04:39.320 --> 04:40.530
That is not it.

04:41.614 --> 04:42.824
It is too quiet around here.

04:44.200 --> 04:46.494
I have not even heard an insect chirp
for a while now.

05:03.594 --> 05:04.595
Your Royal Highness,

05:05.805 --> 05:07.348
there is a house up ahead.

05:22.822 --> 05:24.073
JIYULHEON

05:31.581 --> 05:33.708
I think this is the place,

05:34.584 --> 05:36.419
but it looks odd for a clinic.

05:36.502 --> 05:38.671
What is the blackish red thing
on the stake?

05:40.298 --> 05:41.341
Is that not blood?

05:45.219 --> 05:46.512
Wait here, Your Royal Highness.

06:29.389 --> 06:30.431
Your Royal Highness.

06:31.015 --> 06:33.851
It is locked from the inside.
I shall climb over the wall.

06:57.333 --> 06:59.168
Mu-yeong, are you there?

07:02.422 --> 07:04.715
Is there a problem inside?

07:06.050 --> 07:07.385
Mu-yeong!

07:09.470 --> 07:10.555
Mu-yeong!

07:11.764 --> 07:13.266
Mu-yeong!

08:14.243 --> 08:16.204
I think something terrible happened

08:16.787 --> 08:18.873
to the people here.

08:18.956 --> 08:20.249
Where is Physician Lee Seung-hui?

08:21.083 --> 08:22.293
We came all this way.

08:22.793 --> 08:24.003
We must find him.

08:25.963 --> 08:27.465
Is anyone there?

08:29.634 --> 08:32.428
It is dangerous. Stay close to me,
Your Royal Highness.

08:37.183 --> 08:38.226
Your Royal Highness!

08:38.309 --> 08:39.810
Are you all right?

08:40.144 --> 08:41.229
Are you hurt?

09:27.942 --> 09:29.068
Pull!

09:39.495 --> 09:41.163
- Why is it so heavy?
- There are several.

09:41.247 --> 09:42.415
- What?
- Grab on!

09:43.624 --> 09:45.376
One, two!

09:45.668 --> 09:47.420
One, two!

09:47.753 --> 09:49.547
One, two!

10:12.486 --> 10:15.489
What brings a high military officer
all the way here from Hanyang?

10:16.073 --> 10:19.160
I heard Physician Lee Seung-hui was good,
so I wanted him to examine my brother.

10:21.495 --> 10:24.165
He looks fine, but he is not well.

10:32.673 --> 10:36.093
My brother rushed out and forgot
his identification tag. Please understand.

10:36.177 --> 10:37.595
I understand.

10:39.221 --> 10:40.640
Did you see anyone suspicious

10:41.140 --> 10:43.059
when you arrived here?

10:43.726 --> 10:45.102
I only saw the corpses.

10:49.607 --> 10:52.818
We found all the corpses
hidden under the deck of each building.

10:53.027 --> 10:54.403
There are 48 in total.

10:54.487 --> 10:56.030
Load them up on the wagon

10:56.113 --> 10:58.282
- and take them to the magistrate's office.
- Yes, sir.

11:08.876 --> 11:10.044
His corpse is not here.

11:10.461 --> 11:11.295
Pardon?

11:12.171 --> 11:13.798
Physician Lee's corpse is not here.

11:15.174 --> 11:16.217
He must be alive.

11:18.552 --> 11:20.888
Is it okay for me to be so happy?

11:20.971 --> 11:23.724
How about a little peek?

11:25.309 --> 11:27.520
Okay, everyone!

11:29.105 --> 11:30.731
Here is to our newly appointed

11:31.315 --> 11:34.235
Magistrate Cho Beom-pal

11:34.735 --> 11:37.822
of the Haewon Cho Clan!

11:38.322 --> 11:39.824
Let us drink to him!

11:41.200 --> 11:42.785
- Thank you.
- Hold on!

11:43.703 --> 11:44.704
Wait! Hold on!

11:47.623 --> 11:50.918
- You must have drunk too much!
- Damn it!

11:58.384 --> 12:00.261
Let me bow before the magistrate

12:00.344 --> 12:03.264
- on this glorious day.
- Sounds great.

12:03.347 --> 12:04.473
Sure!

12:04.557 --> 12:06.934
May you live long and prosper!

12:10.896 --> 12:13.149
My lord!

12:15.192 --> 12:16.986
My lord!

12:18.028 --> 12:19.989
- Something terrible happened.
- What?

12:23.784 --> 12:25.578
How can I possibly believe you?

12:37.548 --> 12:40.843
What is all this?

12:40.926 --> 12:43.929
Are these all corpses?

12:44.096 --> 12:45.514
They were found

12:45.765 --> 12:47.850
in Jiyulheon on Geumjeong Mountain.

12:52.271 --> 12:54.023
Not on my first day in office...

12:56.609 --> 12:59.236
What about the culprit?
Do we know who did this?

12:59.820 --> 13:01.238
There is a suspect.

13:01.447 --> 13:04.074
A man named Yeong-sin,
who was being treated at the clinic,

13:04.492 --> 13:06.577
has been gathering bamboo poles
from all around Dongnae

13:06.911 --> 13:07.912
for the past few days.

13:07.995 --> 13:10.247
- Did you say--
- Bamboo?

13:10.331 --> 13:13.459
There were bamboo spears
on top of the walls of the clinic.

13:13.542 --> 13:15.544
Bamboo spears? Why?

13:15.628 --> 13:17.004
Probably to keep people out,

13:17.129 --> 13:18.923
so they would not find the corpses.

13:19.632 --> 13:22.009
I checked his identification tag,
and it belonged to a man

13:22.092 --> 13:23.719
who died in a war three years ago.

13:26.263 --> 13:27.598
That man is suspicious!

13:27.681 --> 13:30.392
Rally up the troops and find him!

13:31.018 --> 13:32.770
Hurry!

13:33.896 --> 13:37.191
What is going on here?

13:39.235 --> 13:42.029
How could something like this happen?

13:43.823 --> 13:45.115
Please, my lord.

13:45.199 --> 13:46.492
What have I done, my lord?

13:46.575 --> 13:49.453
- I did not do anything.
- Talk to the magistrate, not me!

13:50.996 --> 13:52.915
I'm not who you are looking for.

13:52.998 --> 13:54.750
Please hear me out, my lord.

14:08.681 --> 14:09.807
He is not whom you seek.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.532
What happened?

14:27.074 --> 14:29.660
They are searching for a man
named Yeong-sin, whom they suspect.

14:31.287 --> 14:32.288
What about Physician Lee?

14:32.371 --> 14:36.125
They are too focused on
finding the culprit to think about him.

14:44.425 --> 14:45.509
Where are you going?

14:45.885 --> 14:48.095
I cannot waste time waiting here.

14:49.179 --> 14:50.681
I must find Physician Lee,

14:51.265 --> 14:53.183
even if I must turn Dongnae upside down.

14:53.267 --> 14:54.518
I agree, Your Royal Highness.

14:55.019 --> 14:58.647
We must find that physician so that I can
return to my wife in Hanyang.

14:58.731 --> 14:59.648
Any plan in mind?

15:00.482 --> 15:02.109
Your Royal Highness just said

15:02.234 --> 15:03.903
we shall turn Dongnae upside down.

15:04.320 --> 15:07.364
Dongnae is tiny compared to Hanyang.

15:07.823 --> 15:09.867
It cannot be that hard
to find the physician.

15:26.091 --> 15:27.426
We are almost there.

15:27.885 --> 15:29.470
We will separate into three groups.

15:30.554 --> 15:33.140
If you see the Crown Prince,
take him to the magistrate's office.

15:45.235 --> 15:47.112
GANGNYEONGJEON

16:48.590 --> 16:51.802
Where is the covenant
with the Crown Prince's signature?

16:52.011 --> 16:53.053
What do you mean?

16:53.679 --> 16:56.724
Take that covenant to Lord Cho Hak-ju.

16:57.016 --> 16:59.852
Then you can prevent any more deaths
of the scholars.

16:59.935 --> 17:01.145
Have you lost your mind?

17:01.228 --> 17:03.522
His Royal Highness abandoned us and fled.

17:03.897 --> 17:05.482
We must find a way to survive.

17:07.568 --> 17:08.652
That is enough.

17:09.903 --> 17:12.448
Do you not know why Lord Cho Hak-ju,

17:12.948 --> 17:15.284
who even went after the Crown Prince,
is leaving you alone?

17:17.453 --> 17:18.787
He wants you to submit to him.

17:18.871 --> 17:21.248
If you, the head of Sungkyunkwan,

17:21.373 --> 17:24.376
bring all of the scholars
over to the Haewon Cho Clan,

17:24.960 --> 17:27.504
he will at least spare the lives
of the scholars.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.214
That is enough.

17:29.548 --> 17:32.426
My lord, we do not know
when the Royal Army will storm in.

17:34.344 --> 17:36.138
We must hand it over
before it is taken away.

17:36.221 --> 17:37.681
That is the only way we can survive.

17:42.811 --> 17:46.398
My lord, you have a guest.

17:50.486 --> 17:51.653
Show the guest in.

17:58.535 --> 18:02.831
What brings the head court lady
of the Crown Prince's palace here?

18:05.417 --> 18:06.418
Come in.

18:09.379 --> 18:11.256
A corpse was found in the King's palace?

18:12.508 --> 18:13.759
I cannot believe it.

18:14.134 --> 18:15.427
How could that be possible?

18:16.053 --> 18:17.429
I feel the same.

18:17.846 --> 18:20.808
Only royalty are permitted
to enter the backyard.

18:21.683 --> 18:23.477
How did you get in?

18:24.686 --> 18:27.898
After hearing that something strange
has been happening in the King's palace,

18:27.981 --> 18:30.275
I risked my life to sneak in to see.

18:31.610 --> 18:32.903
Please believe me.

18:33.529 --> 18:37.199
How could I lie about something
that my life depends on?

18:39.493 --> 18:40.577
I understand.

18:41.495 --> 18:42.746
You may go.

18:53.173 --> 18:55.342
This gives us hope.

19:00.389 --> 19:02.391
If what she says is true,

19:02.850 --> 19:05.394
that means something terrible
happened in the King's palace.

19:05.894 --> 19:09.273
Lord Cho Hak-ju hid that from us.

19:11.275 --> 19:12.860
If we find out what happened,

19:13.569 --> 19:16.321
we may be able to destroy
the Haewon Cho Clan.

19:16.405 --> 19:21.410
We may be able to save the scholars,
His Royal Highness, and ourselves.

19:26.290 --> 19:29.251
DONGNAE

19:51.857 --> 19:52.983
May I help you?

19:57.321 --> 19:59.698
Are you Kim, the medicinal herb supplier?

20:01.533 --> 20:02.409
I hear

20:03.577 --> 20:07.122
you supplied medicinal herbs to Jiyulheon.

20:08.248 --> 20:10.667
I know nothing about what happened.

20:11.418 --> 20:13.629
No. We are here about something else.

20:14.671 --> 20:17.382
We are looking for Physician Lee Seung-hui
for something important.

20:17.883 --> 20:19.343
Do you know where he is?

20:20.344 --> 20:23.222
All I did was supply herbs.
I do not know anything.

20:24.139 --> 20:26.391
My apologies, but I am busy.

20:26.558 --> 20:28.352
He is not done talking.

20:28.435 --> 20:31.355
Do those of lowly birth not learn manners?

20:36.318 --> 20:37.486
My elderly father

20:38.403 --> 20:40.781
has not eaten all day
because of all the fuss.

20:41.782 --> 20:43.867
I shall at least bring him some water.

20:45.118 --> 20:46.828
If you wish to flog me, go ahead.

20:47.454 --> 20:48.789
I am going to draw water.

20:56.922 --> 21:00.592
Sorry. My colleague is like that
because he was spoiled as a child.

21:01.134 --> 21:02.386
Please be understanding,

21:03.011 --> 21:04.888
and tell me if you know anything.

21:05.222 --> 21:07.307
I will compensate you generously.

21:08.267 --> 21:09.893
I told you already.

21:10.477 --> 21:13.438
I have not seen him in months.

21:16.984 --> 21:19.945
Anything will do.
Please tell me something.

21:23.365 --> 21:25.033
It is for an important matter.

21:25.575 --> 21:27.494
I will not notify the government.

21:30.622 --> 21:31.581
Yesterday,

21:33.458 --> 21:37.879
Seo-bi, a physician at Jiyulheon,
came to see me.

21:38.922 --> 21:41.049
There is a survivor from Jiyulheon?

21:43.385 --> 21:45.053
Where is she now?

21:46.596 --> 21:47.931
I do not know,

21:48.890 --> 21:50.600
but she probably went to Frozen Valley.

21:51.101 --> 21:52.477
She came to me

21:53.437 --> 21:56.606
and asked all about
the resurrection plant that grows there.

21:56.690 --> 21:59.151
People say it can bring the dead
back to life.

21:59.651 --> 22:01.069
She was so out of it.

22:02.195 --> 22:03.989
She did not seem normal.

22:05.907 --> 22:07.075
What did you say?

22:07.159 --> 22:09.119
A plant that brings the dead back to life?

22:09.202 --> 22:10.162
Yes.

22:10.954 --> 22:13.540
But there is no such thing in this world.

22:14.541 --> 22:16.209
Where is this "Frozen Valley"?

22:19.004 --> 22:21.089
It is called "Frozen Valley"
since it is so cold there

22:21.173 --> 22:22.799
that the water stays frozen
all year round.

22:23.175 --> 22:26.094
I heard it was in Gomi Mountain,
on the north side of Dongnae.

22:37.147 --> 22:40.233
Stay here, Your Royal Highness.
I shall go by myself.

22:40.525 --> 22:43.612
No. I'm scared to be left alone.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.709
It already feels like winter here.

23:00.003 --> 23:01.588
Your Royal Highness, stay behind me.

23:03.840 --> 23:04.925
Your Royal Highness!

23:23.902 --> 23:25.862
Your Royal Highness, it's dangerous.

23:48.301 --> 23:50.804
That is what the dead female physicians
at Jiyulheon were wearing.

23:59.646 --> 24:03.775
Are you Seo-bi,
the physician from Jiyulheon?

24:08.989 --> 24:10.240
Come out.

24:13.910 --> 24:16.288
It is okay. Come out.

24:41.229 --> 24:42.647
Where is Physician Lee Seung-hui?

24:46.193 --> 24:48.653
We came all the way from Hanyang
in search for him.

24:49.154 --> 24:50.238
Where is he?

24:52.032 --> 24:53.116
Physician Lee

24:55.869 --> 24:58.705
could not avoid the disaster.

24:59.664 --> 25:00.999
What do you mean?

25:02.000 --> 25:03.168
Is he dead?

25:08.173 --> 25:09.216
It is...

25:10.759 --> 25:12.177
all because of...

25:13.386 --> 25:15.096
the resurrection plant.

25:16.848 --> 25:19.100
He said that the plant

25:19.851 --> 25:25.148
caused everything that happened
in Hanyang and at Jiyulheon.

25:26.149 --> 25:27.359
What do you mean?

25:28.318 --> 25:29.945
Are you saying the deaths at Jiyulheon

25:30.362 --> 25:32.280
are related to what happened in Hanyang?

25:36.284 --> 25:39.204
How did you know
that the people died at Jiyulheon?

25:41.498 --> 25:43.625
Did you see them?

25:45.544 --> 25:46.586
Yes.

25:48.755 --> 25:51.925
They took the corpses to the magistrate's
office to investigate the incident.

25:54.302 --> 25:57.556
Did you move them out of Jiyulheon?

25:59.558 --> 26:00.725
No.

26:01.893 --> 26:05.063
No. Those people are not dead.

26:05.855 --> 26:07.440
It must be stopped.

26:14.990 --> 26:15.949
Damn it!

26:16.032 --> 26:17.117
Who are you?

26:18.785 --> 26:19.869
Stop!

26:23.790 --> 26:25.166
I asked who you were!

26:25.250 --> 26:26.418
Where are they?

26:26.960 --> 26:27.919
Where did they go?

26:28.003 --> 26:29.296
Why you...

26:29.963 --> 26:31.214
Where are the people

26:32.007 --> 26:33.550
who were here?

26:47.105 --> 26:49.399
What happened?

26:51.318 --> 26:53.820
It looks like a beast mauled her,

26:53.903 --> 26:57.449
but the size of the bite marks
is too small

26:58.158 --> 26:59.451
to be those of a tiger or a wolf.

27:01.786 --> 27:04.164
Then was it a fox?

27:05.206 --> 27:06.416
No.

27:08.543 --> 27:10.837
They do not look like
an animal's bite marks.

27:11.755 --> 27:15.550
They match bite marks of a human being.

27:15.800 --> 27:18.053
What? Of a human being?

27:18.261 --> 27:21.222
What? That is absurd.

27:21.806 --> 27:24.184
How could a person bite
another person to death?

27:26.686 --> 27:27.854
Out of my way!

27:28.104 --> 27:29.105
Move!

27:35.779 --> 27:38.365
You cannot leave them here!
You must lock them up!

27:39.074 --> 27:42.285
Who are you to create a ruckus
at the magistrate's office?

27:42.369 --> 27:44.037
I am the man

27:45.163 --> 27:46.081
you were looking for.

27:47.290 --> 27:48.792
I saw everything!

27:48.875 --> 27:50.335
These people are not dead!

27:50.418 --> 27:52.128
He looks like the man we seek.

27:52.212 --> 27:53.088
What?

27:53.505 --> 27:54.839
He is the culprit.

27:55.173 --> 27:56.174
What?

27:56.257 --> 27:58.051
What are you doing? Arrest him!

28:11.731 --> 28:13.108
These people are not dead!

28:13.191 --> 28:15.819
They will soon wake up and attack people!

28:16.528 --> 28:18.029
Please believe me!

28:18.113 --> 28:20.573
Why are you not arresting that lunatic?

28:20.657 --> 28:21.825
Arrest him now!

28:25.704 --> 28:27.747
Oh, my. The corpses will catch on fire.

28:47.809 --> 28:49.060
No!

29:04.409 --> 29:05.827
Where do you think you are going?

29:06.745 --> 29:09.873
There is no time. They will wake up soon.

29:10.290 --> 29:11.791
This wench is insane.

29:11.875 --> 29:13.626
The dead will wake up?

29:13.710 --> 29:15.920
No. It is all true.

29:16.004 --> 29:17.297
What were you saying?

29:17.922 --> 29:20.633
You said that the plant caused something
in Hanyang and at Jiyulheon.

29:21.217 --> 29:25.388
My master said he saved a dead man
in Hanyang with the resurrection plant.

29:26.473 --> 29:28.433
The exact same thing happened
at Jiyulheon.

29:28.516 --> 29:31.728
The dead people came back to life
as monsters.

29:31.811 --> 29:33.772
We must go and stop them!

29:33.855 --> 29:36.858
What were those people who died
and came back to life like?

29:37.442 --> 29:40.487
Did they have a stench
and make sounds of a beast?

29:42.906 --> 29:44.282
That is correct.

29:46.951 --> 29:48.661
Do you have evidence
to prove what you claim?

29:49.329 --> 29:52.916
Physician Lee's journals are kept
in the medicine shed at Jiyulheon.

29:52.999 --> 29:55.043
Everything is written there.

29:55.126 --> 29:56.961
He said if we find the resurrection plant,

29:57.045 --> 29:59.714
we can figure out how to cure the disease.

29:59.798 --> 30:02.175
I came here to find a cure for them.

30:02.258 --> 30:03.510
Please believe me.

30:03.593 --> 30:04.594
I do not have time.

30:04.677 --> 30:08.181
We must go before the sun sets
and prevent any further deaths.

30:10.225 --> 30:11.559
I will go to Jiyulheon.

30:11.851 --> 30:14.354
Go to the magistrate's office with her
and confirm her assertions.

30:14.437 --> 30:16.940
No. How could you believe
a crazy wench and--

30:17.023 --> 30:18.316
It is a grave matter.

30:19.484 --> 30:21.528
Go and confirm whether it is true or not.

30:29.536 --> 30:30.662
Lead the way.

31:58.374 --> 32:00.627
Is this what you came for?

32:05.298 --> 32:07.842
All the way here to Dongnae?

32:10.553 --> 32:12.680
This is His Majesty's command.

32:19.771 --> 32:24.734
"Upon interrogating the 89 scholars
who distributed propaganda,

32:25.735 --> 32:27.779
it was uncovered that the mastermind

32:29.238 --> 32:31.199
behind it all was the Crown Prince.

32:31.699 --> 32:34.202
Bring the Crown Prince
to the Royal Investigation Bureau

32:34.285 --> 32:35.870
and get the whole account

32:37.372 --> 32:40.333
of the conspiracy."

32:44.963 --> 32:48.257
I shall obey His Majesty's command
and take you to Hanyang.

32:48.800 --> 32:51.260
I will not bind you
since you are the Crown Prince

32:51.344 --> 32:52.845
of this nation, after all.

32:54.639 --> 32:56.432
Please follow me quietly.

32:59.519 --> 33:00.937
His Majesty's command...

33:03.523 --> 33:05.900
Does this nation truly have a King?

33:06.818 --> 33:08.945
What do you mean?

33:09.529 --> 33:11.739
Why did you call Physician Lee Seung-hui
to Hanyang?

33:12.365 --> 33:15.368
He is the best at treating smallpox.

33:15.451 --> 33:16.828
Then what did he use

33:17.620 --> 33:18.913
the resurrection plant for?

33:20.999 --> 33:23.418
Did my father pass away?

33:26.170 --> 33:29.882
Of course he did not, Your Royal Highness.

33:30.717 --> 33:31.718
His Majesty is...

33:32.635 --> 33:34.554
still alive.

33:35.847 --> 33:39.809
To tell you the truth, his mental capacity
is not exactly there.

33:40.935 --> 33:45.023
However, he will be fine
until the Queen gives birth.

33:48.901 --> 33:50.445
Do you want it that badly?

33:53.614 --> 33:56.034
Do you want to covet power that badly?

33:57.076 --> 34:00.538
Is that why you committed acts that
someone who serves the King must not do?

34:02.457 --> 34:04.208
Do you want it that badly?

34:06.419 --> 34:08.796
What have you done, Your Royal Highness?

34:10.381 --> 34:12.967
You were only lucky to be born
as the son of the King.

34:13.843 --> 34:15.762
You have done nothing.

34:16.345 --> 34:20.475
And yet, you always looked
at my father and me

34:22.977 --> 34:25.730
with that look you have now.

34:27.231 --> 34:30.151
As if you were saying, "I am different

34:31.402 --> 34:32.779
from you disgusting insects."

34:34.614 --> 34:36.074
You are correct.

34:36.574 --> 34:37.700
You are insects.

34:38.284 --> 34:40.953
You scorned the King and the royal family.

34:41.370 --> 34:43.664
You brought misery upon the people!

34:44.540 --> 34:47.460
That is what you,
the Haewon Cho Clan, have done.

34:54.467 --> 34:56.677
You told me to strike you, did you not?

34:58.763 --> 35:00.556
I shall grant your wish today.

35:08.606 --> 35:10.608
You said I was simply lucky?

35:11.526 --> 35:12.443
No.

35:13.194 --> 35:14.862
I was chosen.

35:16.155 --> 35:18.950
With the power bestowed upon me
by my father,

35:19.575 --> 35:20.910
I shall...

35:22.954 --> 35:24.288
punish you.

35:26.874 --> 35:29.127
You cannot kill a person with that sword.

36:42.783 --> 36:45.077
You should not have been born
as the Crown Prince.

37:42.718 --> 37:44.303
Confess right now!

37:44.387 --> 37:47.598
- Why did you kill those people?
- Say something!

37:47.682 --> 37:49.892
How many times must I tell you?

37:50.518 --> 37:52.895
They are monsters. They do not die.

37:53.646 --> 37:56.816
We must all flee before the sun sets.

37:57.400 --> 37:59.235
He has lost his mind.

37:59.986 --> 38:01.195
Strike him again!

38:11.747 --> 38:13.082
Excuse me.

38:15.668 --> 38:16.669
My lord!

38:17.253 --> 38:18.296
Please let me in!

38:18.379 --> 38:20.298
I am a physician at Jiyulheon!

38:25.761 --> 38:26.971
Send her in!

38:31.684 --> 38:33.102
What he speaks is the truth.

38:33.686 --> 38:35.354
These people are not dead.

38:35.980 --> 38:39.108
Once the sun sets,
they will rise and maul people to death.

38:39.734 --> 38:41.777
You must lock them up right away.

38:45.448 --> 38:47.700
Have they lost their minds?

38:47.783 --> 38:49.368
Please believe me.

38:49.452 --> 38:51.245
You must lock them up quickly.

38:51.329 --> 38:54.332
Otherwise, all the people in Dongnae
will be put in danger.

39:03.466 --> 39:05.551
You must flee. Hurry!

39:14.101 --> 39:16.354
Imprison those lunatics
right this instant!

39:16.604 --> 39:17.438
Lock them up!

39:18.105 --> 39:21.692
My lord. My lord!
You must evacuate the people!

39:22.276 --> 39:24.487
You must flee right now!

39:24.570 --> 39:27.573
Flee! You must flee!

39:29.325 --> 39:30.493
- Why that...
- Run!

39:30.576 --> 39:31.952
She is so loud.

39:33.537 --> 39:35.748
Why would we flee from the corpses?

39:44.715 --> 39:46.008
It moved.

40:45.860 --> 40:48.279
The royal physician was correct.

40:48.821 --> 40:50.281
His Majesty...

40:51.407 --> 40:53.117
has passed away.

40:56.579 --> 40:59.206
Passed away? What are you saying?

41:00.583 --> 41:02.042
His Majesty is alive.

41:11.469 --> 41:12.803
One month from now...

41:14.889 --> 41:18.184
Until the Queen gives birth to a prince,

41:19.894 --> 41:21.937
he has to stay alive.

41:22.855 --> 41:25.191
- Lord Cho.
- Why are you hesitating?

41:26.692 --> 41:29.361
It is the physician's duty
to save the King.

41:31.197 --> 41:34.617
All you must do is do your duty.

41:37.745 --> 41:39.413
Do not fear anything.

41:41.290 --> 41:43.167
Just do what you did

41:45.503 --> 41:47.338
three years ago.

42:31.090 --> 42:32.299
It moved!

42:32.883 --> 42:33.926
What did?

42:58.659 --> 43:01.120
Hey!

43:02.538 --> 43:05.457
Hey, try lifting that up!

43:06.917 --> 43:08.043
Go on!

43:26.562 --> 43:28.063
- What...
- Why that...

43:28.147 --> 43:29.898
Just use your hand.

43:29.982 --> 43:31.734
Be a man! Why are you such a coward?

44:05.267 --> 44:06.852
What is that...

44:15.861 --> 44:17.863
- The corpse is...
- Honey!

44:18.238 --> 44:19.323
Honey!

44:19.615 --> 44:21.867
Let me go! That is my wife!

44:21.950 --> 44:23.118
She is my wife!

44:23.202 --> 44:25.871
Honey! Darling!

44:26.455 --> 44:28.082
Honey.

44:28.165 --> 44:30.376
Darling! Darling...

53:40.926 --> 53:43.345
Subtitle translation by Jeong Lee
